ope="row" class="py-3 pr-3 text-left align-top text-[12px] font-medium leading-relaxed text-[var(--ink)]">Beta<div aria-hidden="true" class="relative mt-2 h-1.5 bg-[var(--tint)]"><span data-testid="trade-partners-bar" class="absolute top-0 left-0 h-full" style="background-color:#654321;width:0%"></span></div></th><td class="py-3 text-right align-top font-[family-name:var(--font-numeric)] text-[12px] whitespace-nowrap text-[var(--ink)]">−1.0</td><td class="py-3 pl-3 text-right align-top font-[family-name:var(--font-numeric)] text-[11px] text-[var(--muted)]">−10.0%</td></tr><tr data-testid="trade-partners-other-row" data-entity-id="other" class="border-b border-[var(--row-border)]"><td class="py-3 pr-2 align-top font-[family-name:var(--font-numeric)] text-[11px] text-[var(--muted)]">—</td><th scope="row" class="py-3 pr-3 text-left align-top text-[12px] font-medium leading-relaxed text-[var(--ink)]">Other</th><td class="py-3 text-right align-top font-[family-name:var(--font-numeric)] text-[12px] whitespace-nowrap text-[var(--ink)]">0.5</td><td class="py-3 pl-3 text-right align-top font-[family-name:var(--font-numeric)] text-[11px] text-[var(--muted)]">5.0%</td></tr></tbody></table></section>"`;
